      "role": "user",
      "content": "the train info for the second leg seems a bit off though, i thought osaka to fukuoka was mostly the sanyo shinkansen line? also, can you give me a more specific breakdown of the actual time difference? like, if i include getting to the airport and security for a flight vs just walking into the station for the train, which one is actually faster in practice?",
      "source": "evaluator"
